                <p>In this lesson, we will calculate the force between two specific masses to understand the magnitude of this force on a human scale.</p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Section: Formula Card -->
        <section class="card" id="formula-section">
            <div class="card-header">
                <svg class="card-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 7h6m0 10v-3m-3 3h.01M9 17h.01M9 14h.01M12 14h.01M15 11h.01M12 11h.01M9 11h.01M7 21h10a2 2 0 002-2V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v14a2 2 0 002 2z"></path></svg>
                <div class="card-title">Main Formula</div>
            </div>
            <div class="card-body">
                <div class="formula-display" id="formula-render">
