                        Open Formula Lab
                    </button>
                </div>

                <div id="formula-explanation" style="display: none; margin-top: 1.5rem; padding-top: 1.5rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);">
                    <h4>Variable Breakdown:</h4>
                    <ul style="margin-top: 0.5rem; margin-left: 1.2rem;">
                        <li><strong>F</strong>: Gravitational Force (Newtons)</li>
                        <li><strong>G</strong>: Gravitational Constant ($6.674 \times 10^{-11} \, \text{N}\cdot\text{m}^2/\text{kg}^2$)</li>
                        <li><strong>m₁, m₂</strong>: Masses of the objects (kg)</li>
                        <li><strong>r</strong>: Distance between the centers of the masses (meters)</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
